{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1447817-aberrant-my-3-page-character-seet","id":1447817,"title":"Aberrant My 3 page character seet","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-07T08:04:03-07:00","id":1447817,"title":"Aberrant My 3 page character seet","content":"Hello,<br /> I'm about to start an aberrant game but I found the character sheet to be missing some things so I learned some basic editing and here is my rough draft. Feel free to download and use. Note: It has some bits from the original sheet.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/1ed1svdysyo9tg3/Leo_Custom_Sheet.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/1ed1svdysyo9tg3/Leo_Custom_Sheet.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/1ed1svdysyo9tg3/Leo_Custom_Sheet.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.dropbox.com/s/1ed1svdysyo9tg3/Leo_Custom_Sheet.pdf?dl=0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <br /> Any ideas or feedback would be nice","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10020-manifoldpersona","name":"Manifoldpersona","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-07T09:50:17-07:00","id":1447825,"title":"","content":"Hi, game designer here (but <i>not </i>a dev; I don't work for Onyx Path).<br /> <br /> I think the most important thing you should know is that when we design a Character Sheet, we must test its use in practice -- not necessarily playing a session with the character, but at least trying to create a character and put him on the sheet, then &quot;pretend&quot; to play in common scenarios. (It's a kind of playtesting). This will show you a lot of things that are not working as intended, and others that are but still can be improved. So, this is my feedback: create a character, put him on the sheet, pretend to play using the sheet. If you spot something to change, then change, create the new prototype Sheet (it doesn't have to be beautiful in this stage, only have the actual spaces for writing), and test it again. When you finally are satisfied with the layout and information, then you can make it more aesthetically pleasing.<br /> <br /> The first thing that comes to mind about your Sheet is that the Scale area probably won't work in practice. Novas don't have a Static Scale value in a whole area (such as &quot;Speed&quot;); what they do have are <i>specific</i> Scale values (sometimes even changing ones) in <i>a specific use </i>of a Scale, such as &quot;Speed Scale to Initiative&quot; (but not for Running) or &quot;Leadership Scale to use in Presence rolls&quot; (but <i>not </i>to Manipulate people, and <i>not </i>to resist Presence rolls), or &quot;Leadership Scale <i>to Resist </i>Social Influence&quot;.<br /> <br /> Hope it'll help. Success for you! :-]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1001-timecrafter","name":"Timecrafter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1001_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-08T06:40:17-07:00","id":1447933,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the feedback. <br /> <br /> I did think about the way they cherry pick scale, but I was thinking a simple visualization would be fun and it harkens back to the graphics on hero cards rather than it being 100% accurate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10020-manifoldpersona","name":"Manifoldpersona","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}